P",{},"示例用 useId 给每个面板建立独立的标题关联，避免重复 ",["CODE",{},"id=\"panel-title\""],"。useId 适合可访问性关联，不应用作列表数据的 key。列表 key 应来自记录自身的稳定 ID。"],"\n",["P",{},"组合也能减少无意义转发。例如布局层只需接收一个已经配置好的编辑器节点，就不用了解编辑器的每个字段。但真正负责决策的父组件仍需要知道它传入了什么，不能用组合隐藏本来应该清楚的业务关系。"],"\n",["H3",{"id":"内容需要子层数据时再用-render-prop"},"内容需要子层数据时再用 render prop"],"\n",["P",{},"如果容器内部算出了阅读进度，调用者想决定显示百分比还是文字，可以让 children 成为函数："],"\n",["DIV",{"class":"code-block","data-language":"tsx"},["DIV",{"class":"code-block__bar"},["SPAN",{},"tsx"],["BUTTON",{"type":"button","class":"code-copy"},"复制代码"]],["PRE",{"class":"hljs"},["CODE",{},["SPAN",{"class":"hljs-keyword"},"import"]," { useState, ",["SPAN",{"class":"hljs-keyword"},"type"]," ",["SPAN",{"class":"hljs-title class_"},"ReactNode"]," } ",["SPAN",{"class":"hljs-keyword"},"from"]," ",["SPAN",{"class":"hljs-string"},"'react'"],";\n\n",["SPAN",{"class":"hljs-keyword"},"function"]," ",["SPAN",{"class":"hljs-title function_"},"Progress"],"(",["SPAN",{"class":"hljs-params"},"{ total, children }: {\n  total: ",["SPAN",{"class":"hljs-built_in"},"number"],";\n  children: (progress: { completed: ",["SPAN",{"class":"hljs-built_in"},"number"],"; remaining: ",["SPAN",{"class":"hljs-built_in"},"number"]," }) => ReactNode;\n}"],") {\n  ",["SPAN",{"class":"hljs-keyword"},"const"]," [completed, setCompleted] = ",["SPAN",{"class":"hljs-title function_"},"useState"],"(",["SPAN",{"class":"hljs-number"},"0"],");\n  ",["SPAN",{"class":"hljs-keyword"},"const"]," current = ",["SPAN",{"class":"hljs-title class_"},"Math"],".",["SPAN",{"class":"hljs-title function_"},"min"],"(completed, total);\n  ",["SPAN",{"class":"hljs-keyword"},"return"]," (\n    ",["SPAN",{"class":"language-xml"},["SPAN",{"class":"hljs-tag"},"<",["SPAN",{"class":"hljs-name"},"section"],">"],"\n      {children({ completed: current, remaining: total - current })}\n      ",["SPAN",{"class":"hljs-tag"},"<",["SPAN",{"class":"hljs-name"},"button"]," ",["SPAN",{"class":"hljs-attr"},"type"],"=",["SPAN",{"class":"hljs-string"},"\"button\""]," "